{"4612290": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Beneath The Surface: Mermaid Hunter", "steam_appid": 4612290, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>[What you can do] :</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4612290/extras/ee9a925e0789b9981c44d27b1890dd5e.poster.avif?t=1776733679\" aria-label=\"HUNT LETHAL MERMAIDS Pilot your submarine through the dark abyss. Track and neutralize dangerous mermaids using your specialized arsenal.\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4612290/extras/ee9a925e0789b9981c44d27b1890dd5e.webm?t=1776733679\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4612290/extras/ee9a925e0789b9981c44d27b1890dd5e.mp4?t=1776733679\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Hunt Monsters:</strong> Use your sub to find and fight scary sea monsters and mermaids.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4612290/extras/12f3812db5808e4e558b2b4c06bea2e7.poster.avif?t=1776733679\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4612290/extras/12f3812db5808e4e558b2b4c06bea2e7.webm?t=1776733679\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4612290/extras/12f3812db5808e4e558b2b4c06bea2e7.mp4?t=1776733679\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Butcher &amp; Loot:</strong> Cut up the creatures you catch to get rare and expensive materials.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4612290/extras/ba000b23c61208aba2967ee5d78e8a37.poster.avif?t=1776733679\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4612290/extras/ba000b23c61208aba2967ee5d78e8a37.webm?t=1776733679\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4612290/extras/ba000b23c61208aba2967ee5d78e8a37.mp4?t=1776733679\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>-&gt; Use </strong>your loots to <strong>Craft</strong> items to sell(trade)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4612290/extras/e85adf4973960e53b7e8281e8bad9960.poster.avif?t=1776733679\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4612290/extras/e85adf4973960e53b7e8281e8bad9960.webm?t=1776733679\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4612290/extras/e85adf4973960e53b7e8281e8bad9960.mp4?t=1776733679\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Craft &amp; Trade:</strong> Use your loot to craft new items. You can sell or trade them at <strong>Scrap Town</strong> (the local market).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loo